      "title": "A Day in the Life of a University Student",
      "paragraphs": [
       "Mariana is nineteen years old and she is a student at the university. She lives with her family in Chihuahua.",
       "Her day starts early. She gets up at six o'clock and she has breakfast with her mother. Her first class is at seven, so she takes the bus at half past six. The bus is slow, but it is cheaper than a taxi.",
       "Mariana has five classes every day. Her favorite subject is anatomy, because the teacher is very clear. Math is her most difficult class.",
       "At two o'clock she has lunch in the cafeteria with her friends. In the afternoon she studies in the library. She doesn't watch television from Monday to Friday.",
       "Mariana works on Saturdays in a small store. She isn't tired, because she is happy: she wants to be a physical therapist."
